#  The Docker build context is the whole repo (see examples/react-landing/
#  Dockerfile), so exclude everything the image does not need — above all the
#  build artifacts that would otherwise be sent to the daemon: Rust target/
#  (multi-GB), Kotlin/Swift build/, and every node_modules/dist. Source the
#  generators read (packages/typescript/src/generated, contract/) is NOT
#  excluded — it has to reach the build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/build
**/.gradle
**/.kotlin
**/.next
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea